{
    "theme": "尋找物品",
    "data": {
        "phase1": [
            {
                "text": "今天家裡要辦婚禮，很多親戚都來了。<br>看到大家忙得不可開交，主角決定要幫大家一起準備。"
            },
            {
                "text": "piyux mincwahi na yaya mu nyan mwah muyax myan!",
                "textCh": "媽媽今天家裡來了好多親戚哦！",
                "sound": "text/sound/66143/923642",
                "image": "girl.png",
                "background": "1-1.png"
            },
            {
                "text": "pkekon kisa qa qbsuyal mu mlikuy, mica piyux calay cquliq nyan mwah.",
                "textCh": "今天是哥哥的婚禮，所以有很多人來。",
                "sound": "text/sound/66143/923643",
                "image": "mom.png",
                "background": "1-2.png"
            },
            {
                "text": "mqas calay lungan mu, bsiyaq calay ini mu ktali naha la.",
                "textCh": "好開心喔！很久沒有看到他們了！",
                "sound": "text/sound/66143/923644",
                "image": "girl.png",
                "background": "1-1.png"
            },
            {
                "text": "uya ay! piyux calay yaw ptiywun ta, usa pkrax mtiyaw naha kisa.",
                "textCh": "對啊！今天大家都會很忙，你要幫忙大家。",
                "sound": "text/sound/66143/923645",
                "image": "mom.png",
                "background": "1-2.png"
            },
            {
                "text": "uya, baqun mu la!",
                "textCh": "好的，我一定會！",
                "sound": "text/sound/66143/923646",
                "image": "girl.png",
                "background": "1-1.png"
            },
            {
                "text": "haka cu lama spuyut alan pckaw na qqaya ha!",
                "textCh": "我要去準備等一下要用的東西了。",
                "sound": "text/sound/66143/923647",
                "image": "mom.png",
                "background": "1-2.png"
            },
            {
                "text": "pkraxay misu ha!",
                "textCh": "我來幫忙！",
                "sound": "text/sound/66143/923648",
                "image": "girl.png",
                "background": "1-1.png"
            },
            {
                "text": "uya, uwah mglux kingan ha!",
                "textCh": "好，你跟我來！",
                "sound": "text/sound/66143/923649",
                "image": "mom.png",
                "background": "1-2.png"
            }
        ],
        "phase2": {
